# Multilingual by default

- Support every enabled European locale from the centralized locale registry (`src/i18n`).
- Every public flow needs an accessible language switcher.
- Language switches must preserve route, query params, referral attribution, and booking context.
- Localize copy, metadata, validation, emails, dates, times, numbers, currencies, pluralization, alt text, and a11y labels.
- A feature is incomplete while an enabled locale is missing content.
- Format dates/money through shared locale-aware utilities (`src/lib/datetime`, `src/lib/pricing`) — never ad hoc in cards.
